{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2025-07/1061992/block/singleImage/3257758/df/04-03_5.jpg?updatedAt=1793778556\"/><p>長沙灣蘇屋邨發生家居意外。今日（4日）下午1時44分，一名獨居中年男子於百合樓4樓一單位窗口墮樓，跌落1樓平台位置，途人發現報警求助。 消防員到場將事主救下，發現他半清醒無法應答，由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院搶救，警方正調查其墮樓原因及經過。據悉，事主當時企圖撿拾窗台位置的物品，期間疑不慎失足。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:45:48.897610+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:49:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:24.192627+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:38:32.022993+00:00","content_hash":"6f1a30f90ff6d9ef941f6c6df01cf9009042906199724c882483660b6d69726e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:45:48.897610+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}